@host = http://localhost:5186

### 1. First time: the model answers, and the answer is stored
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many rows can I export?", "tenantId": "acme" }

### 2. Same text: exact hit, no model call and no embedding
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many rows can I export?", "tenantId": "acme" }

### 3. Different words, same question: semantic hit
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "What is the maximum number of rows in an export?", "tenantId": "acme" }

### 4. Near miss: almost the same distance, and the yes/no check rejects it
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many columns can I export?", "tenantId": "acme" }

### 5. Same near miss with the check off: the wrong answer comes back
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many columns can I export?", "tenantId": "acme", "verify": false }

### 6. Another tenant never sees Acme's answer
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "How many rows can I export?", "tenantId": "globex" }

### 7. Live data is never stored
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Has my export finished?", "tenantId": "acme" }

### 8. Changing a limit raises the revision, so old answers stop matching
POST {{host}}/api/tenants/acme/policy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exportLimit": 20000 }

### 9. What is in the cache
GET {{host}}/api/cache?tenantId=acme
